  <XDFHEADER>
    <flags>0x1</flags>
    <fileversion>7427-custom-1.0</fileversion>
    <deftitle>7427 MANUAL IDLE DEVELOPMENT - not Rev A</deftitle>
    <description>64 KiB full-address image, base offset zero. Profile: manual_idle_dev. Pristine reference SHA-256: 264beb0140e470a8d63a83da74f460fb8864b6027711a26207b308fe9ae2d0b4. DEVELOPMENT DEFINITION ONLY: the replacement controller has not been released as a BIN. Never use its 0x9F00 controls on Rev A: those addresses contain executable code there. Original source: Advanced $31 TP5 v251.xdf, author 93V8S10. Known omitted/repurposed definitions removed and reviewed custom controls added. Remaining engine definitions retain supplied conversions; this is not a new proof of every inherited unit. One base spark table is active. Startup/coolant/knock/deceleration corrections and timing limits remain. Custom air is internal controller air units, not motor steps or measured percent flow. Inherited checksum metadata is preserved. Validate image layout and checksum with tools/verify_custom_xdf.py. One runtime learned value resets on restart. New gains/cold-air defaults remain development calibration.</description>
    <author>93V8S10; custom 7427 project adaptation</author>
    <BASEOFFSET offset="0" subtract="0" />
    <DEFAULTS datasizeinbits="8" sigdigits="2" outputtype="1" signed="0" lsbfirst="0" float="0" />
